transition of care services from the hospital to outpatient, further increasing outpatient volumes, access, and chronic disease management. In addition to offering in-person appointments, we will also leverage our telemedicine platform to increase access to care for our patients. The candidate may also assist with training and co-management of patients with residents in our outpatient clinic in Baltimore City."
    },
